Yes, let's try the foot bath.

295
00:14:44,424 --> 00:14:47,063
This feels amazing.

296
00:14:47,087 --> 00:14:49,784
The view is great too.

297
00:14:49,808 --> 00:14:52,575
We can do some food tasting as well.

298
00:14:52,598 --> 00:14:55,731
Yes, it's such a fun place.

299
00:14:55,754 --> 00:14:59,208
Toyosu is wonderful.

300
00:14:59,232 --> 00:15:01,811
Where should we go next?

301
00:15:01,835 --> 00:15:04,635
I want to go to Odaiba.

302
00:15:04,658 --> 00:15:07,391
Let's take the Yurikamome Line.

303
00:15:07,414 --> 00:15:09,263
Where's the station?

304
00:15:09,286 --> 00:15:11,686
It's right over there.

305
00:15:11,709 --> 00:15:14,514
My bags are heavy.

306
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:17,435
Because we bought so many souvenirs.

307
00:15:17,458 --> 00:15:20,306
Yes, I'm very satisfied.

308
00:15:20,329 --> 00:15:23,933
The view from the Yurikamome Line is great too.

309
00:15:23,957 --> 00:15:27,090
It runs over the water, doesn't it?

310
